@# Basic authored hubs for health, fitness, personal care, and faith places.

@entry place.hub.clinic
  @scene place.clinic
  @place-key clinic
  @hub place
@endentry

:: place.clinic [place hub]
@kind place
@heading "Clinic"
@choices "Activities"

The reception area of {{place.name}} smells faintly of disinfectant.

@choice reception "Speak to reception" -> place.clinic
  @icon 🗣️
@endchoice

@choice wait "Wait to be seen" -> place.clinic
  @icon 🪑
@endchoice

@choice leave "Leave" -> @leave-place
  @icon 🚪
  @time 1m
@endchoice

